116	4-detector ens.\      & 4 & 0.785 & 0.700 & 22.8 \\
117	7-feature (ours)      & 7 & 0.774 & 0.705 & \textbf{9.7} \\
118	\midrule
119	Avg-LogProb           & 1 & 0.707 & 0.673 & --- \\
